        <mxCell id="lg" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Arrows follow the &lt;i&gt;call direction&lt;/i&gt;, top to bottom:&lt;br&gt;entry point → tool surface → gates → data access → world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; green = provided and complete &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; orange = homework hole&lt;br&gt;blue = generated ground truth &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; red = external service&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The seed layer (bottom left) builds the world once, before any request.&lt;br&gt;Help-center retrieval is on page 2." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
